{"kind":"request","text":"Builder: lane B, the git engine and landing operation. Promote the approved Sandbox git spike into Artroom's publisher: forks and scoped tokens, head pinning, bounded tree diffs, merge preview, and the durable landing operation with reservation, a single publication slot, complete-forward recovery and the unresolved state.","body":{"conditions":"A git package plus the publisher container image, building on the contract package (lane 0, under review; depend on its branch and note it) and the approved spike code at spikes/sandbox-git. It must: (1) create lane forks and mint fork-scoped, lease-bound tokens, revoking them on release or expiry; (2) pin proposed heads into refs/artroom/heads/\u003clane\u003e/\u003cgeneration\u003e in the canonical repo; (3) compute bounded, hash-cached path diffs through the Artifacts binding, with old and new paths for renames; (4) preview merges in the publisher sandbox (git only, hooksPath=/dev/null, no repository scripts) when paths overlap; (5) implement the landing operation per plan section 8 and the contract: a SQLite-durable LandOp, synchronous reservation, a single publication slot, a per-publication 60 s write token, the three-way push outcome (rejected / error / unknown), complete-forward recovery with the same integration and lease, an unresolved state that holds the slot and is visible to admins, crash reconciliation by an alarm, and no release of the slot on elapsed time; (6) test every acceptance case in plan section 8 and the matching contract rules that can be exercised without the Room: pause the push and submit acts, delayed authenticated push after a forward retry, forward retry failing, crash before push and after push before the receipt, two parallel preparations, and a lease race; (7) measure, against a real Artifacts repo, whether token revocation or expiry stops an in-flight push, and record the result in a dated note; (8) README and plain-English notes per ISO 24495-1.","target_head":"5b23bc914c729687b42336e6c280377a3689606b","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_repo":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}